  "content": "<p>若要下載此模組的資料包版本，請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><p>為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事</a>的切菜板增加更多適用於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">我們走過的生物群系</a>的合成配方。</p><ul>\n<li>所有木材種類的樹皮、剝皮及回收功能</li>\n<li>更多染料來源：\n<ul>\n<li>可合成1個染料的花朵</li>\n<li>藍莓</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花朵切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/blueberrycutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"藍莓切割\"></p><p>想要將所有農夫切割整合為單一模組？請查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫切割合集</a>！</p>",
